      Brewed for 2m 26s\n\n\u203B recap: We're building the Unity game \"\u30BB\u30DF\u30D5\u30A1\u30A4\u30CA\u30EB\"
      together; just finished listing every Japanese/English character actually used
      in-game so you can rebuild the TMP font asset. Next: paste that character list
      into Font Asset Creator's Custom Characters field and regenerate.\n\n\u276F
